# yt_transcript

yt_transcript is a Python tool for extracting and processing YouTube video transcripts.

## Features

- Download transcripts from YouTube videos
- Save transcripts in various formats
- Simple command-line interface

## Installation

Clone the repository and install dependencies:


## Usage

```bash
python yt_transcript/cli.py --help


Usage: cli.py [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  Command line interface for yt-transcript

Options:
  --help  Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  download-audio  Download the audio of a YouTube video
  transcript      Get the transcript of a YouTube video and output it to... 
```



### Download transcript from a YouTube video
To download the transcript of a YouTube video, use the following command:
```bash
python yt_transcript/cli.py transcript "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uXs-zPc63kM" -o transcript.txt
```

### Download audio from a YouTube video
To download audio from a YouTube video, use the following command:
```bash
python -m yt_transcript.cli download-audio "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mM5Oks8yZc" -o Yoga_Nidra_For_Deep_Rest.mp3 -q lowest
```

